* ============================================================
* DATADICT_SMOKE.DTS
*
* Purpose:
*   Minimal readback smoke for the DDICT bridge surface.
*
* Safety:
*   Read-only.
* ============================================================

SET ECHO ON
DO metadata

ECHO ===== DDICT FIELDS/TAGS SMOKE START =====
DDICT FIELDS DDOBJECT
DDICT FIELDS DATA_DICTIONARY_OBJECTS
DDICT TAGS DDOBJECT
DDICT TAGS DATA_DICTIONARY_OBJECTS
ECHO ===== DDICT FIELDS/TAGS SMOKE END =====
